                                "sense_id": "c1a2b895-8dc2-3d08-a6f3-deebde4d4119",
                                "text": "The evening, though sunless, had been warm and muggy for the season, and Tess had come out with her milking-hood only, naked-armed and jacketless; certainly not dressed for a drive."
                            },
